OL,3,GNEWSAChurch marks 200 years of historic
OL,4,Aangel statues
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Somerset church is celebrating 200
OL,7,Fyears since a group of angel statues
OL,8,Fwith links to kings, queens, Sir
OL,9,FChristopher Wren and Westminster Abbey,
OL,10,Farrived in the county.
OL,12,FSt Andrew's Church in Burnham-on-Sea,
OL,13,Fhas been marking the anniversary with a
OL,14,Fseries of community events, culminating
OL,15,Fwith a rededication and blessing
OL,16,Fservice later.
OL,18,FThe 17th Century sculptures once formed
OL,19,Fpart of King James II's altarpiece at
OL,20,FWhitehall palace and survived a palace
OL,21,Ffire and political upheaval, before
OL,22,Fbeing brought to St Andrew's in 1826.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
