OL,3,GNEWSAChurch marks 200 years of historic
OL,4,Aangel statues
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Reverend Cheryl Hawkins, Vicar of
OL,7,FBurnham-on-Sea Benefice, said the
OL,8,Fanniversary has given the church an
OL,9,Fopportunity to bring the community
OL,10,Ftogether.
